.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt IRQ_SHARED 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm irq_dispatch
.Nd dispatch shared IRQ handlers
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/irq.h
.Ft int
.Fn irq_dispatch "unsigned int irq" "void *frame"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn irq_dispatch
function invokes all handlers currently registered on an IRQ line and
returns a non-zero value if any handler reports the interrupt as handled.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr request_irq 9
